{"speciesId":734,"names":{"fr":"Manglouton","es":"Yungoos","en":"Yungoos","ja":"ヤングース"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Avec ses crocs acérés, il ne peut s’empêcher de mordre tout ce qui bouge. Il fut introduit à Alola il y a longtemps, depuis une autre région."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Sus afilados colmillos lo atraviesan todo. No es autóctono de Alola, sino que proviene de otra región."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"With its sharp fangs, it will bite anything. It did not originally live in Alola but was imported from another region."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"鋭いキバで なんにでも かみつく。 元々 アローラには 棲んでおらず 他の地方から 連れてこられた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il furète du matin au soir en quête de nourriture. La nuit, exténué, il tombe comme une brique et s’endort sur place."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Deambula todo el día en busca de alimento. Al anochecer, exhausto, se deja caer en cualquier lugar y se queda dormido."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It wanders around in a never-ending search for food. At dusk, it collapses from exhaustion and falls asleep on the spot."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"餌を 探し うろつき続ける。 日が 暮れるころには 疲れ果て 倒れ込むように その場で 眠る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Son estomac occupe la plus grande partie de son long corps. Le Dresseur de ce gros mangeur doit prévoir un budget nourriture conséquent."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"El estómago le ocupa gran parte de su largo cuerpo. Alimentar a este auténtico tragaldabas no es moco de pavo, por el coste que conlleva."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Its stomach takes up most of its long torso. It’s a big eater, so the amount Trainers have to spend on its food is no laughing matter."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"長い 胴体の 中身は ほとんど 胃袋。 大食いなので エサ代は バカに ならない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il mange de tout, mais aime particulièrement les proies fraîches, voire encore vives. Il erre sur les routes à leur recherche."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Pese a ser omnívoro, siente predilección por los alimentos frescos o incluso seres vivos. Por eso marcha por los caminos en busca de presas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Although it will eat anything, it prefers fresh living things, so it marches down streets in search of prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"なんでも 食べるが 新鮮で 生きているものが いいので 獲物を 探して 道を 練り歩く。"}],"varieties":[{"id":734,"moves":[{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[17,"level-up",10],[18,"level-up",10],[25,"level-up",10]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[17,"level-up",28],[18,"level-up",28],[25,"level-up",28],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thrash","learns":[[17,"level-up",43],[18,"level-up",43],[25,"level-up",40]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[17,"level-up",3],[18,"level-up",3],[25,"level-up",3]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[17,"level-up",19],[18,"level-up",19],[25,"level-up",19]]},{"name":"earthquake","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"dig","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"bide","learns":[[17,"level-up",16],[18,"level-up",16]]},{"name":"rest","learns":[[17,"level-up",46],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",46],[18,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",43],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-fang","learns":[[17,"level-up",37],[18,"level-up",37]]},{"name":"super-fang","learns":[[17,"level-up",25],[18,"level-up",25],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"level-up",25],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"substitute","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thief","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"snore","learns":[[18,"tutor",0]]},{"n